<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head') %>

</head>
<body>
<%- include('partials/header') %>
<main>

<section class="sh-page-hero" aria-label="About hero">
  <div class="sh-container">
    <h1>About Share Hubs Engineering</h1>
    <p>A Lagos-based engineering company turning ideas into precision-manufactured reality for industries across Nigeria and beyond.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sh-section" aria-labelledby="purpose-heading">
  <div class="sh-container">
    <div class="sh-section-title"><h2 id="purpose-heading">Our Purpose</h2></div>
    <div class="sh-grid sh-grid--3">
      <article class="sh-card sh-card--feature sh-animate">
        <h3 style="color:var(--sh-brand);margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-4);">Vision</h3>
        <p>To be a leading engineering fabrication company in Africa, delivering innovative, affordable, and sustainable solutions that improve lives and transform industries through research and technology.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="sh-card sh-card--feature sh-animate">
        <h3 style="color:var(--sh-brand);margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-4);">Mission</h3>
        <p>To design, fabricate, and develop world-class engineering products that are innovative, affordable, and sustainable — empowering industries and communities while improving human living through research and technology.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="sh-card sh-card--feature sh-animate">
        <h3 style="color:var(--sh-brand);margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-4);">Goal</h3>
        <p>To become a recognized solution center for engineering innovation, delivering sustainable technologies that improve lives and transform industries across Africa and beyond.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Certifications — REALISTIC -->
<section class="sh-section" style="background:var(--sh-surface);" aria-labelledby="cert-heading">
  <div class="sh-container">
    <div class="sh-section-title">
      <h2 id="cert-heading">Commitment to Quality</h2>
      <p>We adhere to rigorous quality standards and industry best practices in every project we undertake.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sh-flex sh-justify-center sh-gap-4 sh-flex-wrap sh-animate">
      <span class="sh-cert"><i class="fa fa-check-circle"></i> CAC Registered</span>
      <span class="sh-cert"><i class="fa fa-check-circle"></i> MAN Member</span>
      <span class="sh-cert"><i class="fa fa-check-circle"></i> Quality Assured</span>
      <span class="sh-cert"><i class="fa fa-check-circle"></i> Safety Compliant</span>
      <span class="sh-cert"><i class="fa fa-check-circle"></i> Made in Nigeria</span>
    </div>
    <div class="sh-text-center sh-mt-8">
      <p class="sh-text-small" style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;">Share Hubs Engineering is registered with the Corporate Affairs Commission (CAC) of Nigeria and maintains active membership with the Manufacturers Association of Nigeria (MAN). We are committed to continuous improvement in our quality management processes and follow industry-standard safety protocols in all fabrication work.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sh-section" aria-labelledby="values-heading">
  <div class="sh-container">
    <div class="sh-section-title"><h2 id="values-heading">Core Values</h2><p>The principles that guide every project we undertake.</p></div>
    <div class="sh-grid sh-grid--3">
      <article class="sh-card sh-animate"><h4 style="color:var(--sh-brand);margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-3);">Innovation</h4><p class="sh-text-small">Harnessing research and creativity to solve real-world engineering challenges.</p></article>
      <article class="sh-card sh-animate"><h4 style="color:var(--sh-brand);margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-3);">Affordability</h4><p class="sh-text-small">Delivering cost-effective solutions without compromising on quality or precision.</p></article>
      <article class="sh-card sh-animate"><h4 style="color:var(--sh-brand);margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-3);">Sustainability</h4><p class="sh-text-small">Promoting eco-friendly engineering practices for a better future.</p></article>
      <article class="sh-card sh-animate"><h4 style="color:var(--sh-brand);margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-3);">Excellence</h4><p class="sh-text-small">Committed to precision, quality, and adherence to global engineering standards.</p></article>
      <article class="sh-card sh-animate"><h4 style="color:var(--sh-brand);margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-3);">Integrity</h4><p class="sh-text-small">Building trust with clients through honesty, transparency, and accountability.</p></article>
      <article class="sh-card sh-animate"><h4 style="color:var(--sh-brand);margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-3);">Customer-Centricity</h4><p class="sh-text-small">Putting industries and people at the heart of every solution we design.</p></article>
      <article class="sh-card sh-animate"><h4 style="color:var(--sh-brand);margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-3);">Impact</h4><p class="sh-text-small">Creating engineering solutions that transform societies and strengthen industries.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sh-section" style="background:var(--sh-surface);" aria-labelledby="why-heading">
  <div class="sh-container">
    <div class="sh-section-title"><h2 id="why-heading">Why Choose Share Hubs Engineering?</h2></div>
    <div class="sh-grid sh-grid--3">
      <article class="sh-card sh-text-center sh-animate">
        <div style="font-size:var(--sh-text-5xl);font-weight:var(--sh-weight-bold);color:var(--sh-brand);line-height:1;margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-4);">01</div>
        <h4>Built for Performance</h4>
        <p class="sh-text-small">Our products are designed to withstand the most challenging industrial environments, ensuring stability and reliability under pressure.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="sh-card sh-text-center sh-animate">
        <div style="font-size:var(--sh-text-5xl);font-weight:var(--sh-weight-bold);color:var(--sh-brand);line-height:1;margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-4);">02</div>
        <h4>Client-Centered Approach</h4>
        <p class="sh-text-small">We work closely with clients to deliver solutions that are practical, cost-effective, and aligned with project goals.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="sh-card sh-text-center sh-animate">
        <div style="font-size:var(--sh-text-5xl);font-weight:var(--sh-weight-bold);color:var(--sh-brand);line-height:1;margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-4);">03</div>
        <h4>Innovation Driven</h4>
        <p class="sh-text-small">We use up-to-date engineering methods and digital tools to ensure every solution meets today's industry demands.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sh-section" aria-labelledby="info-heading">
  <div class="sh-container">
    <div class="sh-section-title"><h2 id="info-heading">Company Information</h2></div>
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
      <div class="col-lg-8">
        <div class="sh-card" style="padding:var(--sh-space-10);">
          <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
              <h5 style="color:var(--sh-brand);margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-2);font-size:var(--sh-text-sm);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;">Phone</h5>
              <p><a href="tel:+2349135116716">+234 913 511 6716</a></p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
              <h5 style="color:var(--sh-brand);margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-2);font-size:var(--sh-text-sm);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;">Industry</h5>
              <p>Manufacturing & Engineering</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
              <h5 style="color:var(--sh-brand);margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-2);font-size:var(--sh-text-sm);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;">Company Size</h5>
              <p>2–10 employees</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
              <h5 style="color:var(--sh-brand);margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-2);font-size:var(--sh-text-sm);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;">Headquarters</h5>
              <p>Lagos, Oshodi, Nigeria</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
              <h5 style="color:var(--sh-brand);margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-2);font-size:var(--sh-text-sm);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;">Founded</h5>
              <p>2022</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
              <h5 style="color:var(--sh-brand);margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-2);font-size:var(--sh-text-sm);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;">Email</h5>
              <p><a href="mailto:info@sharehubseng.com">info@sharehubseng.com</a></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
<%- include('partials/scripts') %>
</body>
</html>
